# This project needs NO environment variables to build or run.
#
# The Gemini API key used by the optional "AI 智能解析" feature is supplied by the user
# at runtime through the in-app 设置 page and kept in the browser's localStorage.
# It is deliberately NOT read from the environment at build time: anything referenced by
# vite.config.ts's `define` gets inlined into the shipped JavaScript, where every visitor
# could read it. See README → 关于 AI 智能解析.
#
# The variables below are what AI Studio injects when this code runs inside AI Studio
# itself. They are kept here only as documentation and are unused by a normal build.
#
# GEMINI_API_KEY  — AI Studio injects this from the Secrets panel at runtime.
# APP_URL         — the Cloud Run service URL, used for self-referential links.
